  "class.a108a404412c": {
   "type": "shape",
   "color": "#d6e4f5",
   "text": "`harness/annotations`\n**Annotation**\n---\n+ flag: str\n+ copied: bool\n---\n+ annotates(target: Any): bool\n+ written_as(): str\n+ installs_member(): bool\n+ companion_flags(): tuple[str, ...]\n+ annotate(target: Any): Any",
