   "text": "`harness/guidance_actions`\n**GuidanceAction**\n---\n+ parameter_notes: dict[str, str]\n+ injects_rules: bool\n+ call: ToolCall | None\n+ work: WorkList\n+ files: ActionFiles\n+ works_in: Any\n+ session: Any\n+ log: Any\n+ graph: Any\n+ operation_type: type[AgentOperation]\n+ practice_slugs: list[str]\n+ session_context: str\n---\n+ GuidanceAction(session: Any, call: ToolCall | None)\n+ for_call(call: ToolCall): GuidanceAction\n+ session_for(call: ToolCall): Any\n+ listed(): list\n+ run(operation: Callable[[Any], Any], action: str): list\n+ log_running(action: str): None\n+ begin(guidance: GuidanceArg | None, action: str): str\n+ act_quickly(): str\n+ inject_rules(payload: HookPayload): dict[str, Any]",
