  "class.fe86af7df469": {
   "type": "shape",
   "color": "#fff2cc",
   "text": "`harness/graph`\n**Graph**\n---\n+ build: GraphBuild\n+ practices: GraphPractices\n+ scope: LoadScope\n+ applied_patterns: PatternOverlays\n+ schema_edges: SchemaEdges\n+ edges: GraphEdges\n+ explorer: GraphExplorer\n+ reads: GraphReads\n+ folder: str\n+ overlays: list[str]\n+ saved_file: SavedGraphFile\n---\n+ Graph(practices: Iterable[PracticeGuidance] | None)\n+ for_call(call: ToolCall): Graph\n+ practice(key: str): PracticeGuidance\n+ node(node_id: str): Node | None\n+ restored_from(saved: SavedGraph): None\n+ load_working_copy(folder: str, practices: dict[str, str], database: str | None, overlays: list[str] | None, force: bool, call: ToolCall | None): GraphLoaded\n+ load_files(folder: str, practices: list[str], files: list[str], overlays: list[str] | None, call: ToolCall | None): GraphLoaded\n+ refresh(paths: list[str], call: ToolCall | None): GraphLoaded\n+ save_json(): GraphSaved\n+ set_overlays(overlays: list[str], call: ToolCall | None): AppliedOverlays\n+ overlay_of(folder: str): Overlay\n+ practice_names(): list[str]\n+ inventory(): Inventory\n+ filter_choices(practices: list[str], node_types: list[str], practices_before: list[str] | None): Filter\n+ source(node_id: str): NodeSource | None\n+ return_nodes(filter: dict | None): list[FilteredNode]\n+ explorer_trees(filter: dict | None): list[ExplorerEntry]\n+ explorer_branch(node_id: str, filter: dict | None): ExplorerEntry | None",
   "kind": "rect",
   "size": "small",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "x": 6464.0,
   "y": 15441.0,
   "w": 1220,
   "h": 717
  },
